  "description": "Reid Classic eBike | Vintage electric commuter bike\nTimeless vintage styling meets modern electric performance – the ideal eBike for comfortable city commutes, everyday journeys and leisurely rides on urban streets and scenic pathways.\nThe Reid Bikes Classic eBike combines a lightweight alloy frame with a 250W rear hub motor and integrated 360Wh battery, delivering smooth electric assistance in a stylish, practical package. Internal cabling creates a clean, refined finish, while the LCD handlebar-mounted display keeps your ride information easy to view.\nA 7-speed drivetrain with an L-TWOO trigger shifter and Shimano rear derailleur provides versatile gearing for tackling varied routes. Upgraded Tektro hydraulic disc brakes deliver reliable stopping power and control, while wide 700x45c commuter tyres enhance stability and comfort across everyday surfaces.\nDesigned with comfort and style in mind, the Classic features a classic-shaped alloy handlebar and quill stem for a relaxed, upright riding position. A comfortable saddle, brown leather grips and alloy platform pedals complement the vintage-inspired design, combining traditional character with modern functionality.\nWith its elegant styling, practical electric assistance and upgraded components, the Reid Bikes Classic eBike is a great choice for riders looking to make everyday cycling more comfortable and enjoyable. From commuting around town to exploring scenic routes, it offers a stylish alternative to conventional transport.\nThe Reid Bikes Classic eBike is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters, looking for electric assistance to make journeys around town easier\n\nVintage bike enthusiasts, combining timeless styling with modern eBike technology\n\nComfort-focused riders, with an upright riding position, comfortable saddle and wide commuter tyres\n\nUrban and leisure cycling, suited to city streets and scenic pathways\n\nRiders tackling varied routes, with 7-speed gearing to adapt to changing terrain\n\nRiders seeking confident braking, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes for reliable stopping power\n\nStyle-conscious cyclists, with brown leather grips, classic handlebars and a refined frame design\n\nRiders looking for practical electric transport, with a 250W rear hub motor and integrated 360Wh battery",
